check 1
# Fire Bolt at a poked fallen, without input: seeds fixed and a fallen
# party spawned as in poke-fallen-town, then before frame 8 a Fire Bolt
# missile (missiles row 58, skill 36 level 1, owner the player) created
# at the player and aimed at the fallen leader 3,3 sub-tiles away
# (specs/tools/poke.md §1 `missile`: 1.14d 0x0059FA30 flags 0x21; d2rs
# create_missile). Compare the missile (type 3) and the party's hp and
# seeds frame by frame: flight, hit, damage and the draws they make.
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name poke-firebolt
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 60
seconds 240
channels state
at 4 poke seed-game 0x00001234 666
at 4 poke seed-unit @player 0x00000055 666
at 4 poke spawn 19 @x+3 @y+3 normal
at 8 poke missile 58 @x @y @x+3 @y+3 skill 36 1
